SUMMARY:Panigiri of Agios Panteleimon\, Panormos
LOCATION:Panormos\, Kalymnos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Kalymnos' Agios Panteleimon feast is at Panormos (Elies)\, the green inland village between Pothia and Myrties: vespers and a big service on the 26th evening\, then a glendi on the square with food and a local band. Bus from Pothia runs late on the night.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/kalymnos/#panormos-panigiri-of-agios-panteleimon-panormos
